{"messages":[{"content":[{"text":"读取 project 下的 feature-brief.md、architecture.md 和 constraints.md，创建 delivery/implementation-plan.md 与 delivery/risk-checklist.md。计划要按依赖顺序拆分任务，说明模块职责和验证；风险清单要列出风险、影响、缓解和验证方式。","type":"text"}],"role":"user","timestamp":1768464000000},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"thinking":"Let me start by reading the project files to understand what's needed.","type":"thinking"},{"arguments":{"path":"project/feature-brief.md"},"id":"call_00_fvMFvc4QcIfoD287DLF30103","name":"read_file","type":"toolCall"},{"arguments":{"path":"project/architecture.md"},"id":"call_01_rMalX14ORWmEIsgZzdFC1343","name":"read_file","type":"toolCall"},{"arguments":{"path":"project/constraints.md"},"id":"call_02_N4gMMdtuHX3jzl8fMb930643","name":"read_file","type":"toolCall"}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","provider":"deepseek","responseId":"5c604d81-c255-4fe3-ab47-786b1f99830d","role":"assistant","stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1768464000000,"usage":{"cacheRead":640,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"cacheRead":0.000001792,"cacheWrite":0,"input":0.00032536,"output":0.000036400000000000004,"total":0.00036355200000000006},"input":2324,"output":130,"reasoning":14,"totalTokens":3094}},{"content":[{"text":"{\n  \"path\": \"project/feature-brief.md\",\n  \"content\": \"# 功能目标\\n\\n为本地桌面应用新增可恢复的后台导入任务。用户可发起导入、查看进度、取消任务，并在重启后继续查看最终结果。\\n\",\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"bytesReturned\": 173,\n  \"sizeBytes\": 173,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1768464000000,"toolCallId":"call_00_fvMFvc4QcIfoD287DLF30103","toolName":"read_file"},{"content":[{"text":"{\n  \"path\": \"project/architecture.md\",\n  \"content\": \"# 当前架构\\n\\nRenderer 只调用 IPC Contract；Main Host 负责进程能力；Product Owner 保存业务状态；Runtime Event 只传递瞬时进度，数据库保存最终任务事实。\\n\",\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"bytesReturned\": 191,\n  \"sizeBytes\": 191,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1768464000000,"toolCallId":"call_01_rMalX14ORWmEIsgZzdFC1343","toolName":"read_file"},{"content":[{"text":"{\n  \"path\": \"project/constraints.md\",\n  \"content\": \"# 约束\\n\\n不得让 Runtime Event 成为最终业务状态；取消必须幂等；失败不能阻止应用启动；本次不实现云同步；验证不包含打包。\\n\",\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"bytesReturned\": 167,\n  \"sizeBytes\": 167,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1768464000000,"toolCallId":"call_02_N4gMMdtuHX3jzl8fMb930643","toolName":"read_file"},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"thinking":"Let me understand the project files:\n\n1. **feature-brief.md**: Goal — add recoverable background import tasks to a local desktop app. Users can initiate imports, view progress, cancel tasks, and continue viewing final results after restart.\n\n2. **architecture.md**: Current architecture:\n   - Renderer only calls IPC Contract\n   - Main Host handles process capabilities\n   - Product Owner saves business state\n   - Runtime Event only passes transient progress; database saves final task facts\n\n3. **constraints.md**: Constraints:\n   - Runtime Event must not become final business state\n   - Cancellation must be idempotent\n   - Failure must not prevent app startup\n   - No cloud sync this time\n   - Verification does not include packaging\n\nNow I need to create:\n- `delivery/implementation-plan.md` — plan broken into tasks by dependency order, explaining module responsibilities and verification\n- `delivery/risk-checklist.md` — risk list with risk, impact, mitigation, and verification method\n\nLet me first check if the delivery directory exists. Then write the two files.\n\nLet me create the plan. I should think carefully about the domain:\n\n- Renderer (UI): initiate import, show progress, cancel, view results after restart\n- IPC Contract: defined API between renderer and main\n- Main Host: process capability (file access, background worker, lifecycle)\n- Product Owner: business state persistence (database = final task facts)\n- Runtime Event: transient progress only (not persisted as final state)\n\nImplementation plan by dependency order:\n\n1. **IPC Contract 定义** — define contract (initiateImport, getImportTask, cancelImport, subscribeProgress). No dependencies. Verification: contract types compile / contract tests.\n\n2. **Product Owner 数据模型与持久化** — task records (id, status, progress fields not final state but facts: submitted, running, cancelled, failed, completed; result location), DB schema, repository. Depends on contract for task DTO shape. Verification: unit tests for repo round-trip; restart persistence test.\n\n3. **Main Host 导入执行器（后台任务）** — background import worker, chunked processing, progress emission via Runtime Event, checkpoint persistence. Depends on Product Owner persistence (write facts) and contract (progress event shape). Verification: integration test with fixture file; progress events observed.\n\n4. **取消机制（幂等）** — cancel command handling: idempotent state transition, cancellation flag checked between chunks, concurrent cancel safe. Depends on executor + persistence. Verification: repeated cancel calls produce same final state; no partial results marked complete.\n\n5. **启动恢复** — on startup, Main Host scans DB for running tasks, marks interrupted ones as failed (or resumes), app starts despite failures. Depends on persistence + executor. Verification: simulated crash, restart, task shows terminal state, app boots.\n\n6. **Renderer 集成** — UI calls IPC, subscribes to progress, displays results; error paths. Depends on contract + executor + recovery. Verification: end-to-end manual/automated UI test.\n\n7. **验证与验收** — run verification suite (no packaging per constraints). Depends on all.\n\nModule responsibilities:\n- Renderer: view + user interaction only, no business logic\n- IPC Contract: typed interface between processes\n- Main Host: process lifecycle, background execution, cancellation enforcement\n- Product Owner: task state machine, persistence of final facts\n- Runtime Event: transient progress channel only\n\nRisk checklist:\n1. Runtime Event 被当作最终状态 → 影响：重启后状态丢失/不一致 → 缓解：仅数据库为事实来源，事件仅瞬时 → 验证：重启后校验 DB 状态与事件无关\n2. 取消竞态（取消与完成同时发生）→ 影响：结果状态错误 → 缓解：状态机原子转换 + 幂等取消 → 验证：并发/重复取消测试\n3. 崩溃时任务悬在 running → 影响：重启后假\"运行中\" → 缓解：启动时恢复扫描，标记中断任务 → 验证：模拟崩溃重启测试\n4. 导入失败阻止应用启动 → 影响：应用不可用 → 缓解：恢复逻辑 try/catch 隔离，失败仅影响任务状态 → 验证：注入失败，确认启动成功\n5. 进度事件积压/顺序乱 → 影响：UI 进度错乱 → 缓解：事件携带任务 ID 与版本/序号，UI 只读展示 → 验证：压力测试事件顺序\n6. 数据库写入与事件不一致 → 影响：用户看到进度与实际不符 → 缓解：先写事实再发事件，事件仅提示刷新 → 验证：核对 DB 与事件序列\n7. 重复导入/并发任务冲突 → 影响：资源竞争 → 缓解：任务 ID 唯一、队列串行或分片锁 → 验证：并发发起测试\n8. 结果文件损坏/不完整 → 影响：导入结果错误 → 缓解：校验和/行数校验，失败标记 → 验证：坏文件注入测试\n9. 大文件导入导致主进程阻塞 → 影响：UI 卡顿 → 缓解：分块异步执行，进度节流 → 验证：大文件基准测试\n10. 升级/迁移导致数据库 schema 变化 → 影响：旧数据不可读 → 缓解：schema 版本化，迁移脚本 → 验证：迁移测试\n\nLet me check the workspace structure first to see what exists, then create the delivery directory and files.\n\nActually, let me check the directory structure quickly to see if there's a delivery dir already.","type":"thinking"},{"arguments":{"path":"."},"id":"call_00_xof4nxXlFz0bXFN5kXmc0237","name":"list_directory","type":"toolCall"}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","provider":"deepseek","responseId":"b4722126-eb52-4041-9dfa-fd831c17d0c6","role":"assistant","stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1768464000000,"usage":{"cacheRead":2944,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"cacheRead":0.0000082432,"cacheWrite":0,"input":0.000060060000000000004,"output":0.00034216000000000004,"total":0.0004104632000000001},"input":429,"output":1222,"reasoning":1179,"totalTokens":4595}},{"content":[{"text":"{\n  \"path\": \".\",\n  \"entries\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"project\",\n      \"kind\": \"directory\",\n      \"path\": \"project\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1768464000000,"toolCallId":"call_00_xof4nxXlFz0bXFN5kXmc0237","toolName":"list_directory"},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"thinking":"The project only has the three markdown files. No existing delivery directory. Let me create the two deliverables.\n\nKey requirements:\n1. feature-brief.md: recoverable background import tasks for local desktop app. Users can start import, view progress, cancel task, and after restart continue viewing final result.\n2. architecture.md: Renderer only calls IPC Contract; Main Host handles process capabilities; Product Owner saves business state; Runtime Event only passes transient progress, database saves final task facts.\n3. constraints.md: Runtime Event must not become final business state; cancellation must be idempotent; failure must not prevent app startup; no cloud sync this time; verification excludes packaging.\n\nDeliverables:\n- delivery/implementation-plan.md: plan split tasks in dependency order, explain module responsibilities and verification.\n- delivery/risk-checklist.md: risk list with risk, impact, mitigation, and verification.\n\nLet me create the delivery directory and write both files. I'll create the directory first, then write both files. Actually write_file may create directories? Typically it needs the directory to exist. Let me create directory first.","type":"thinking"},{"arguments":{"path":"delivery"},"id":"call_00_AI206oYlYysmjuUGmNrX9336","name":"create_directory","type":"toolCall"}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","provider":"deepseek","responseId":"03585b09-0fe9-43f9-b5b9-8f334f7c53a8","role":"assistant","stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1768464000000,"usage":{"cacheRead":3328,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"cacheRead":0.000009318399999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"input":0.00002142,"output":0.00007532,"total":0.0001060584},"input":153,"output":269,"reasoning":224,"totalTokens":3750}},{"content":[{"text":"{\n  \"path\": \"delivery\",\n  \"created\": true\n}","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1768464000000,"toolCallId":"call_00_AI206oYlYysmjuUGmNrX9336","toolName":"create_directory"},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"thinking":"Now I'll write the implementation plan and risk checklist based on the three source documents.\n\nKey facts:\n- Feature: recoverable background import tasks for a local desktop app. Users can initiate import, view progress, cancel tasks, and continue viewing final results after restart.\n- Architecture: Renderer only calls IPC Contract; Main Host handles process capabilities; Product Owner saves business state; Runtime Event only carries transient progress, database saves final task facts.\n- Constraints: Runtime Event must not become final business state; cancellation must be idempotent; failures must not block app startup; no cloud sync this time; verification doesn't include packaging.\n\nPlan should break down tasks by dependency order, explain module responsibilities and verification. Risk checklist: risk, impact, mitigation, verification.\n\nLet me write both files in Chinese since the source docs are Chinese.","type":"thinking"},{"arguments":{"content":"# 可恢复后台导入任务 — 实施计划\n\n依据：`project/feature-brief.md`、`project/architecture.md`、`project/constraints.md`\n\n## 目标\n\n为本地桌面应用新增可恢复的后台导入任务：用户可发起导入、查看进度、取消任务，并在重启后继续查看最终结果。\n\n## 分层职责（遵循现有架构）\n\n| 层 | 职责 | 边界 |\n|---|---|---|\n| Renderer | 发起导入、轮询进度、点击取消、展示任务列表与结果 | 只调用 IPC Contract，不直接触碰业务状态 |\n| IPC Contract | 定义 `start-import` / `get-task` / `list-tasks` / `cancel-task` 等通道及参数、返回结构 | 与渲染层唯一的通信面 |\n| Main Host | 进程能力：任务执行、定时进度推送、取消中断、重启后恢复调度 | 不保存最终业务状态 |\n| Product Owner | 保存并读取任务最终事实（状态、结果、错误），提供取消幂等处理 | 唯一最终业务状态来源 |\n| Runtime Event | 只传递瞬时进度（如百分比、当前行数） | 永不落库、不作为最终状态 |\n| 数据库 | 持久化任务事实，供重启后恢复与查询 | 最终事实的唯一存储 |\n\n## 任务拆分（按依赖顺序）\n\n### 阶段 A：数据与状态基础（无依赖，先行）\n\n- **A1. 数据库表与仓储**\n  - 说明：新增 `import_tasks` 表（id、类型、状态、总行数、完成行数、错误信息、最终结果、创建/更新时间）。状态机：`pending → running → succeeded | failed | canceled`。\n  - 职责归属：Product Owner + 数据库。\n  - 验证：单测覆盖状态迁移与持久化读写；重启后数据仍在。\n\n- **A2. 任务状态机与取消幂等语义**\n  - 说明：定义 `cancel` 处理规则——任务已是终态（succeeded/failed/canceled）时重复取消直接返回成功，不产生副作用；运行中取消标记为 canceled 并触发中断。\n  - 职责归属：Product Owner。\n  - 验证：单测覆盖“取消已终态任务”“取消运行中任务”“并发重复取消”三种场景。\n\n### 阶段 B：主进程执行与事件（依赖 A1）\n\n- **B1. 导入执行器（Main Host）**\n  - 说明：执行导入逻辑，接收取消信号，周期性把瞬时进度通过 Runtime Event 发出；结束时只把最终事实写入 Product Owner。\n  - 职责归属：Main Host（执行）、Product Owner（落最终状态）。\n  - 验证：集成测试确认事件流只含瞬时进度、终态只来自数据库；取消信号能中断执行。\n\n- **B2. 进度事件通道（Runtime Event）**\n  - 说明：定义瞬时进度事件结构（taskId、percent、processedRows），仅供 UI 展示，无持久化路径。\n  - 职责归属：Main Host → Renderer。\n  - 验证：测试确认事件不含且不更新任何最终业务状态字段。\n\n### 阶段 C：IPC 契约与界面（依赖 B1、B2）\n\n- **C1. IPC Contract 实现**\n  - 说明：实现 `start-import`、`get-task`、`list-tasks`、`cancel-task` 通道；Renderer 仅经由此层访问。\n  - 职责归属：Main Host 与 Renderer 共同遵守契约。\n  - 验证：契约测试确认请求/响应结构与文档一致；渲染层无直接状态访问。\n\n- **C2. UI 交互**\n  - 说明：发起导入按钮、进度展示（订阅 Runtime Event 刷新）、取消按钮、任务列表与重启后的结果展示。\n  - 职责归属：Renderer。\n  - 验证：手工/UI 测试覆盖发起、进度更新、取消、重启后查看结果。\n\n### 阶段 D：恢复与容错（依赖 A1、B1）\n\n- **D1. 启动恢复**\n  - 说明：应用启动时由 Product Owner 读取未完成/已完成任务，恢复中断的 running 任务或将其标记为 failed（可配置策略），保证失败不阻止应用启动。\n  - 职责归属：Main Host + Product Owner。\n  - 验证：模拟崩溃后重启，应用正常启动且任务状态符合预期。\n\n- **D2. 端到端验收**\n  - 说明：按 feature-brief 场景走完整链路：发起 → 进度 → 取消 → 重启 → 查看结果。\n  - 职责归属：全部模块联调。\n  - 验证：端到端测试通过；确认 Runtime Event 未成为任何最终状态；取消幂等；启动不被失败阻断；无云同步；本阶段不涉及打包验证。\n\n## 依赖关系图\n\n```\nA1 ──> A2 ──> B1 ──> C1 ──> C2\n  \\        \\      └─> D1 ──> D2\n   └────────┘\n```\n\n- A1、A2 无前置依赖，可并行。\n- B1、B2 依赖 A1（A2 的幂等语义为 B1 的取消提供前提，实际依赖 A1+A2）。\n- C1 依赖 B1、B2；C2 依赖 C1。\n- D1 依赖 A1、B1；D2 为最终联调。\n\n## 每项任务的验证方式\n\n| 任务 | 验证方式 |\n|---|---|\n| A1 | 单元测试（状态迁移、持久化、重启后数据仍在） |\n| A2 | 单元测试（终态重复取消、运行中取消、并发取消） |\n| B1 | 集成测试（事件仅瞬时进度、终态仅来自数据库、取消可中断） |\n| B2 | 集成测试（事件不写最终状态） |\n| C1 | 契约测试（通道与结构一致、渲染层无直接访问） |\n| C2 | UI 测试（发起/进度/取消/重启后查看） |\n| D1 | 崩溃恢复测试（重启正常启动、任务状态正确） |\n| D2 | 端到端验收（完整场景通过） |\n","path":"delivery/implementation-plan.md"},"id":"call_00_i9T1sGjveZIdGMKW0St19575","name":"write_file","type":"toolCall"}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","provider":"deepseek","responseId":"fb4d4538-168f-4688-8506-836dae60ac48","role":"assistant","stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1768464000000,"usage":{"cacheRead":3456,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"cacheRead":0.0000096768,"cacheWrite":0,"input":0.00001358,"output":0.00044576,"total":0.00046901680000000005},"input":97,"output":1592,"reasoning":167,"totalTokens":5145}},{"content":[{"text":"{\n  \"path\": \"delivery/implementation-plan.md\",\n  \"bytesWritten\": 5252,\n  \"created\": true,\n  \"overwritten\": false,\n  \"fingerprint\": \"2d48f2b3e5ff86834985d55f8402c5cf37092b853d93ddf51cc6626011dc34a1\"\n}","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1768464000000,"toolCallId":"call_00_i9T1sGjveZIdGMKW0St19575","toolName":"write_file"},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"arguments":{"content":"# 可恢复后台导入任务 — 风险清单\n\n依据：`project/feature-brief.md`、`project/architecture.md`、`project/constraints.md`\n\n| 风险 | 影响 | 缓解 | 验证方式 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Runtime Event 被当作最终业务状态（如进度落库、UI 直接写状态） | 违反架构约束；重启后结果不可信 | 明确事件仅含瞬时字段（percent、processedRows）；最终事实一律经 Product Owner 写库 | 代码审查 + B2 集成测试断言事件不更新任何最终状态字段 |\n| 取消非幂等（重复取消报错或产生副作用） | 用户操作失败、状态错乱 | 状态机在终态直接返回成功；取消处理加锁/原子状态迁移 | A2 单元测试覆盖终态重复取消、运行中取消、并发取消 |\n| 崩溃/重启后任务状态丢失或恢复失败 | 用户无法查看最终结果，违背核心目标 | 任务事实持久化到数据库；启动时由 Product Owner 恢复并重调度中断任务 | A1 持久化单测 + D1 崩溃恢复测试（模拟崩溃后重启） |\n| 失败任务阻断应用启动 | 应用不可用 | 启动恢复逻辑捕获所有任务异常，失败任务标记为 failed 而非抛错阻塞 | D1 测试：注入失败任务后应用仍正常启动 |\n| 进度推送过频导致 UI 卡顿或主进程负担 | 性能问题、体验下降 | 节流/合并瞬时进度事件；事件仅用于展示 | B1 集成测试 + 性能冒烟检查 |\n| 取消后任务仍在后台写库（竞态） | 状态不一致，终态被覆盖 | 执行器先检查取消标志再落终态；终态写入为原子操作 | B1 集成测试覆盖取消竞态场景 |\n| Renderer 绕过 IPC Contract 直接访问状态 | 分层架构被破坏，难以维护 | 契约测试强制渲染层只经 IPC；代码审查把关 | C1 契约测试断言渲染层仅依赖 IPC 通道 |\n| 恢复策略歧义（running 任务恢复重跑 vs 标记失败） | 行为不一致、数据重复导入 | 明确并文档化恢复策略（本次采用可配置策略，默认标记 failed） | D1 测试按文档化策略断言 |\n| 任务结果超过存储限制或含敏感数据 | 存储膨胀、安全问题 | 结果字段限长/裁剪；敏感信息脱敏后入库 | 代码审查 + A1 仓储测试 |\n| 范围蔓延（云同步、打包等非本次范围） | 交付延期 | 以 constraints.md 为准，验收不包含打包，不实现云同步 | D2 端到端验收清单核对范围 |\n","path":"delivery/risk-checklist.md"},"id":"call_00_ET_YoGuvOzmfqfYJET3BIP68961","name":"write_file","type":"toolCall"}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","provider":"deepseek","responseId":"6a345515-70c5-4fcf-b7f5-b90ad50694d8","role":"assistant","stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1768464000000,"usage":{"cacheRead":3456,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"cacheRead":0.0000096768,"cacheWrite":0,"input":0.00022596,"output":0.00018592,"total":0.0004215568},"input":1614,"output":664,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":5734}},{"content":[{"text":"{\n  \"path\": \"delivery/risk-checklist.md\",\n  \"bytesWritten\": 2442,\n  \"created\": true,\n  \"overwritten\": false,\n  \"fingerprint\": \"0d58ab7952e79cfd5a4c1432a28bed679636e29f8a2bdec1ec0ee4018ec768e8\"\n}","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1768464000000,"toolCallId":"call_00_ET_YoGuvOzmfqfYJET3BIP68961","toolName":"write_file"},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"thinking":"Both files are created. Let me verify they exist.","type":"thinking"},{"arguments":{"path":"delivery"},"id":"call_00_dnV8gI2SdXRjbQ6qttqK4859","name":"list_directory","type":"toolCall"}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","provider":"deepseek","responseId":"75975bab-3e7f-4aac-83ef-e364d51cf6e2","role":"assistant","stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1768464000000,"usage":{"cacheRead":5632,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"cacheRead":0.0000157696,"cacheWrite":0,"input":0.000027300000000000003,"output":0.000015680000000000002,"total":0.000058749600000000004},"input":195,"output":56,"reasoning":11,"totalTokens":5883}},{"content":[{"text":"{\n  \"path\": \"delivery\",\n  \"entries\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"implementation-plan.md\",\n      \"kind\": \"file\",\n      \"path\": \"delivery/implementation-plan.md\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"risk-checklist.md\",\n      \"kind\": \"file\",\n      \"path\": \"delivery/risk-checklist.md\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1768464000000,"toolCallId":"call_00_dnV8gI2SdXRjbQ6qttqK4859","toolName":"list_directory"},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"已完成。已读取三份项目文档并创建两份交付文档。\n\n**产出**\n- `delivery/implementation-plan.md` — 实施计划\n- `delivery/risk-checklist.md` — 风险清单\n\n**实施计划要点**\n- 分层职责表：Renderer 只走 IPC Contract；Main Host 负责进程能力；Product Owner 保存业务状态；Runtime Event 仅传瞬时进度；数据库保存最终事实。\n- 按依赖顺序拆分 8 个任务（A1 数据库与状态机 → A2 取消幂等 → B1 执行器 / B2 事件通道 → C1 IPC 契约 / C2 UI → D1 启动恢复 → D2 端到端验收），含依赖关系图和每项任务的验证方式。\n\n**风险清单要点**\n- 10 项风险，每项含影响、缓解、验证方式，重点覆盖约束中强调的：Runtime Event 不得成为最终状态、取消幂等、失败不阻断启动、不实现云同步、验证不含打包。\n\n两份文件均已写入 `delivery/` 目录并确认存在。","type":"text"}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","provider":"deepseek","responseId":"4ea5a507-92ea-42b4-ba67-b6719bd140ad","role":"assistant","stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1768464000000,"usage":{"cacheRead":5760,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"cacheRead":0.000016128,"cacheWrite":0,"input":0.00003052,"output":0.00006552000000000001,"total":0.000112168},"input":218,"output":234,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":6212}},{"content":[{"text":"现在再读取 project/review-notes.md，复审你刚才创建的两个文件。发现遗漏或矛盾就直接修订原文件，并在最终回复中说明修订了哪些问题。不要新建第三份交付文档。","type":"text"}],"role":"user","timestamp":1768464000000},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"arguments":{"path":"project/review-notes.md"},"id":"call_00_ET_beZmCHTfdsDjrGqS8LFh1573","name":"read_file","type":"toolCall"}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","provider":"deepseek","responseId":"4ec24466-3842-4897-b2f4-720e26e01920","role":"assistant","stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1768464000000,"usage":{"cacheRead":6144,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"cacheRead":0.000017203199999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"input":0.000016100000000000002,"output":0.00001372,"total":0.0000470232},"input":115,"output":49,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":6308}},{"content":[{"text":"{\n  \"path\": \"project/review-notes.md\",\n  \"content\": \"# 复审重点\\n\\n检查计划是否误把瞬时事件当持久状态；是否遗漏重启恢复和幂等取消；风险清单必须为每个高风险项给出验证方式。\\n\",\n  \"offset\": 0,\n  \"bytesReturned\": 173,\n  \"sizeBytes\": 173,\n  \"hasMore\": false\n}","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1768464000000,"toolCallId":"call_00_ET_beZmCHTfdsDjrGqS8LFh1573","toolName":"read_file"},{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"thinking":"Let me review my two files against the review notes:\n\n1. 检查计划是否误把瞬时事件当持久状态 (Check if the plan mistakenly treats transient events as persistent state)\n2. 是否遗漏重启恢复和幂等取消 (Whether restart recovery and idempotent cancellation are missing)\n3. 风险清单必须为每个高风险项给出验证方式 (Risk checklist must give verification methods for each high-risk item)\n\nLet me re-read my files and check for issues.\n\nImplementation plan:\n- B2 进度事件通道 - \"仅供 UI 展示，无持久化路径\" - good\n- B1 - \"结束时只把最终事实写入 Product Owner\" - good\n- A2 取消幂等 - covered\n- D1 启动恢复 - covered\n- 依赖关系图 - let me check: A1 ──> A2 ──> B1 ... wait, does A2 depend on A1? A2 is 取消幂等语义. Actually the dependency graph says A1 ──> A2, but A2 (cancellation idempotency semantics) doesn't really depend on A1 (database). Actually the table says \"A1、A2 无前置依赖，可并行\" but the dependency graph shows A1 ──> A2. That's a contradiction!\n\nLet me check the implementation plan:\n\n```\nA1 ──> A2 ──> B1 ──> C1 ──> C2\n  \\        \\      └─> D1 ──> D2\n   └────────┘\n```\n\nThe graph shows A1 → A2 (A2 depends on A1), but the text says \"A1、A2 无前置依赖，可并行。\" That's a contradiction. Also \"B1、B2 依赖 A1（A2 的幂等语义为 B1 的取消提供前提，实际依赖 A1+A2）\" - hmm, this says B1 depends on A1, and actually depends on A1+A2. But the graph shows A2 ──> B1, meaning B1 depends on A2. The graph lines: \"A1 ──> A2 ──> B1\" so B1 depends on A2 which depends on A1. But text says \"B1、B2 依赖 A1\" — B1 depends on A1 only per text, but the graph says B1 depends on A2. There's ambiguity.\n\nActually wait, the graph line 2: \"\\        \\      └─> D1 ──> D2\" - the └─> from A1... no wait. Let me parse:\n\n```\nA1 ──> A2 ──> B1 ──> C1 ──> C2\n  \\        \\      └─> D1 ──> D2\n   └────────┘\n```\n\n- Row 1: A1 → A2 → B1 → C1 → C2\n- Row 2: the \"\\\" under A1 goes to \"└─> D1\" (A1 → D1), the \"\\\" under A2 goes to \"└─> D1\"? Hmm, \"\\        \\      └─> D1\" — the second \\ is under A2, pointing down to the └─> D1. So A2 → D1 too? And \"└────────┘\" connects back... This is confusing ASCII art.\n\nThe text below says:\n- A1、A2 无前置依赖，可并行。\n- B1、B2 依赖 A1（A2 的幂等语义为 B1 的取消提供前提，实际依赖 A1+A2）。\n- C1 依赖 B1、B2；C2 依赖 C1。\n- D1 依赖 A1、B1；D2 为最终联调。\n\nSo text says A1 and A2 have no prerequisites and can be parallel. But the graph shows A1 → A2. Contradiction. Also, D1 depends on A1, B1 — but B1 depends on A2 (for cancellation), so D1 transitively depends on A2. The graph's A2 → D1 line might indicate that, but it's ambiguous.\n\nThis is a genuine contradiction I should fix: either A2 depends on A1 or they're parallel. A2 (状态机与取消幂等语义) doesn't need the database; it's a state machine definition. A1 (数据库表与仓储) stores the state. They're largely independent — the state machine could be defined first, or the DB first. Making them parallel is cleaner. So I should fix the graph to show A1 and A2 parallel, both feeding B1 and D1.\n\nLet me also check other potential issues:\n\n1. \"误把瞬时事件当持久状态\" — the plan explicitly says B2 events are transient only. But is there any place where the plan lets events become state? In C2 UI: \"进度展示（订阅 Runtime Event 刷新）\" — that's fine, UI subscribes for display only. In B1: \"周期性把瞬时进度通过 Runtime Event 发出；结束时只把最终事实写入 Product Owner\" — good.\n\nBut wait — one subtle issue: in A1, the table includes \"完成行数\" (completed rows) which could be seen as transient progress being persisted. Hmm. The table has 总行数、完成行数、错误信息、最终结果. Is 完成行数 a transient progress value persisted? The constraint says Runtime Event must not become final business state, and DB saves final task facts. Persisting 完成行数 in the DB is a \"final task fact\" (e.g., total rows completed at end), which is fine as long as during execution, progress is only via events and the DB is only updated at completion... Actually, if the DB stores 完成行数 updated during execution, that would blur the boundary. The review note asks: \"检查计划是否误把瞬时事件当持久状态\". My A1 mentions the table with 完成行数 but doesn't specify when it's written. To be safe, I could clarify that the DB row is written at final state transitions (creation + final update), and 完成行数 is the final count persisted at completion — progress during execution flows only via Runtime Event. Let me add a clarification to A1: 表字段仅记录最终事实；执行期间进度不写库，仅在任务到达终态时一次性写入完成行数等最终数据。\n\nActually, hmm. Is that over-engineering? The review note explicitly says to check this. Adding a clarifying sentence strengthens it. Let me add: \"执行期间不得将瞬时进度写入该表；进度仅经 Runtime Event 传递，任务到达终态时一次性写入最终完成行数。\"\n\n2. \"是否遗漏重启恢复和幂等取消\" — I have D1 启动恢复 and A2 取消幂等. Both covered. But let me double check D1 covers \"重启后继续查看最终结果\" — D1 says \"应用启动时由 Product Owner 读取未完成/已完成任务，恢复中断的 running 任务或将其标记为 failed\". And C2 says \"重启后的结果展示\". D2 end-to-end covers \"发起 → 进度 → 取消 → 重启 → 查看结果\". OK covered.\n\n3. \"风险清单必须为每个高风险项给出验证方式\" — all 10 risks have 验证方式 columns. Good.\n\nAdditional issues to check for contradiction:\n\n- In implementation plan, B1 验证 says \"取消信号能中断执行\" and B2 验证 says \"测试确认事件不含且不更新任何最终业务状态字段\". Good.\n\n- The dependency graph contradicts the text. Fix the graph.\n\n- A1 says \"验证：单测覆盖状态迁移与持久化读写\" — state machine is A2's concern (A2 defines 取消幂等 and states). A1 covering 状态迁移 overlaps with A2. Not necessarily a contradiction, but A1 covers DB + state machine transitions... Actually A1 says \"状态机：pending → running → succeeded | failed | canceled\" and A2 says \"定义 cancel 处理规则\". There's overlap: A1 defines the state machine, A2 defines cancel semantics. Fine, but the validation duplication (\"状态迁移\" test in both A1 and A2? A1's 验证 says \"单测覆盖状态迁移与持久化读写\", A2's 验证 says \"单测覆盖...三种场景\" which includes 并发重复取消. The 状态迁移 in A1 could be interpreted as full state machine testing which belongs to A2. Minor overlap, not critical. I could adjust A1's validation to \"持久化读写与表结构\" and leave 状态迁移 tests to A2. That removes overlap. Let me refine: A1 验证：单测覆盖表结构与持久化读写（含重启后数据仍在）。A2 验证：状态机迁移 + 取消幂等三场景。That's cleaner.\n\n- Risk checklist: \"取消后任务仍在后台写库（竞态）\" — mitigation mentions 原子状态迁移. Good, has verification.\n\n- Risk #9 \"任务结果超过存储限制或含敏感数据\" — is that a high-risk item? It has verification anyway. Fine.\n\n- One more check on constraints: \"验证不包含打包\" — D2 says \"本阶段不涉及打包验证\" and risk #10 mentions 验收不包含打包. Good.\n\n- \"本次不实现云同步\" — risk #10 mentions no cloud sync. Good.\n\nNow let me also re-verify the \"B1、B2 依赖 A1（A2 的幂等语义为 B1 的取消提供前提，实际依赖 A1+A2）\" text vs graph. The graph shows A2 → B1 (via A1 → A2 → B1). Text says B1 depends on A1+A2. So after fixing the graph to parallel A1/A2, B1 should depend on A1+A2, and the graph should show both A1 and A2 feeding B1.\n\nD1 依赖 A1、B1 — but D1 is 启动恢复 which needs cancellation idempotency? Recovery reads DB (A1) and re-schedules (B1). B1 transitively includes A2. Fine as stated.\n\nLet me redraw the graph:\n\n```\nA1 ──┐\n     ├──> B1 ──> C1 ──> C2\nA2 ──┘      │\n     └──> D1 ──> D2\n```\n\nHmm, D1 depends on A1 and B1. So:\n\n```\nA1 ──┬──> B1 ──> C1 ──> C2\nA2 ──┘   │\n         └──> D1 ──> D2\n```\n\nWait, D1 also depends on A1 directly (reads DB at startup). B1 → D1 covers A1 transitively since B1 depends on A1. But A2? D1 recovery doesn't need A2's idempotent cancel per se, but B1 already includes it. Let me write:\n\n```\nA1 ──┬──> B1 ──> C1 ──> C2\nA2 ──┘   │\n         └──> D1 ──> D2\n```\n\nAnd the bullet list:\n- A1、A2 无前置依赖，可并行。\n- B1 依赖 A1（执行器需要数据库）与 A2（取消依赖幂等语义）；B2 依赖 A1（事件结构本身不依赖，但事件与执行器联调需要 A1）— hmm, does B2 actually depend on A1? B2 is the event channel structure; it doesn't need the DB. The text said \"B1、B2 依赖 A1\". B2 arguably doesn't depend on A1 at all — it's just an event definition. But it pairs with B1 for integration tests. To keep it simple: B1 依赖 A1+A2；B2 无前置依赖（仅事件结构定义），与 B1 联调时依赖 B1。Hmm, but that changes the plan structure. Is this worth it? The review note doesn't specifically ask about B2's dependency. The current text \"B1、B2 依赖 A1（A2 的幂等语义为 B1 的取消提供前提，实际依赖 A1+A2）\" is a bit muddled — it says B1、B2 depend on A1, then clarifies B1 actually depends on A1+A2. It doesn't clarify B2's actual dependency. B2 (event channel) truly doesn't need the DB. Let me make it precise: \"B1 依赖 A1（执行落库）与 A2（取消幂等）；B2 仅定义事件结构，无数据依赖，但其集成验证依赖 B1（事件由执行器发出）\".\n\nActually let me be careful not to over-engineer the revision. The review notes ask three specific things:\n1. 计划是否误把瞬时事件当持久状态 → add explicit clarification in A1/A2/B2 about progress not persisted; also check the D1 \"恢复中断的 running 任务\" — recovery implies the DB knows a task was running, which is a final fact (status=running persisted at start? or derived?). Hmm. When a task starts, is \"running\" persisted? If yes, that's a final fact (task fact: it was started), and progress is separate. That's consistent: DB holds task facts (including current phase status like running), Runtime Event holds instantaneous progress (percent). The constraint says \"Runtime Event 只传递瞬时进度，数据库保存最终任务事实\" — so DB may hold status transitions; percent/progress stays in events. My A1 table includes 完成行数 — I'll clarify it's written only at terminal state. Good.\n\n2. 是否遗漏重启恢复和幂等取消 → both present; confirm in reply.\n\n3. 风险清单每个高风险项有验证方式 → all rows have 验证方式; confirm.\n\nPlus the graph/text contradiction (A1 → A2 vs 可并行) — genuine bug to fix.\n\nAlso A1/A2 validation overlap — minor, fix.\n\nLet me also double-check the risk checklist for \"每个高风险项给出验证方式\" — every row has a 验证方式 cell. Good.\n\nOne more: in implementation plan C2 UI \"验证：手工/UI 测试覆盖发起、进度更新、取消、重启后查看结果\" — includes restart viewing. Good.\n\nAlso check: does the plan anywhere treat Runtime Event as persistent? B2: \"仅供 UI 展示，无持久化路径\" — good. Risk #1 covers it. \n\nNow let me make the edits.\n\nEdit 1 (implementation-plan.md): A1 说明 — add explicit \"执行期间进度不写库，仅到达终态时一次性写入最终完成行数等最终事实\".\n\nCurrent A1 text:\n```\n- **A1. 数据库表与仓储**\n  - 说明：新增 `import_tasks` 表（id、类型、状态、总行数、完成行数、错误信息、最终结果、创建/更新时间）。状态机：`pending → running → succeeded | failed | canceled`。\n  - 职责归属：Product Owner + 数据库。\n  - 验证：单测覆盖状态迁移与持久化读写；重启后数据仍在。\n```\n\nNew:\n```\n- **A1. 数据库表与仓储**\n  - 说明：新增 `import_tasks` 表（id、类型、状态、总行数、完成行数、错误信息、最终结果、创建/更新时间）。状态机：`pending → running → succeeded | failed | canceled`。该表只保存任务最终事实：执行期间的瞬时进度（百分比、当前行数）一律不写库，仅经 Runtime Event 传递；完成行数等数值只在任务到达终态时一次性写入。\n  - 职责归属：Product Owner + 数据库。\n  - 验证：单测覆盖表结构与持久化读写（含重启后数据仍在）；确认执行期间无进度写库路径。\n```\n\nEdit 2: A2 验证 refine:\nCurrent: `- 验证：单测覆盖“取消已终态任务”“取消运行中任务”“并发重复取消”三种场景。`\nThat's fine actually. And A1's 状态迁移 test moved to... hmm, if I remove 状态迁移 from A1's validation, where does it go? A2 covers cancel scenarios; state machine transitions (pending→running→succeeded etc.) should be tested somewhere. A2 is \"任务状态机与取消幂等语义\" — its name includes 状态机. So A2 验证 could include 状态机迁移. Let me update A2 验证: `单测覆盖状态机全量迁移与“取消已终态任务”“取消运行中任务”“并发重复取消”三种场景。`\n\nEdit 3: Fix dependency graph and bullets.\n\nCurrent:\n```\n## 依赖关系图\n\n```\nA1 ──> A2 ──> B1 ──> C1 ──> C2\n  \\        \\      └─> D1 ──> D2\n   └────────┘\n```\n\n- A1、A2 无前置依赖，可并行。\n- B1、B2 依赖 A1（A2 的幂等语义为 B1 的取消提供前提，实际依赖 A1+A2）。\n- C1 依赖 B1、B2；C2 依赖 C1。\n- D1 依赖 A1、B1；D2 为最终联调。\n```\n\nNew:\n```\n## 依赖关系图\n\n```\nA1 ──┬──> B1 ──> C1 ──> C2\nA2 ──┘   │\n         └──> D1 ──> D2\n```\n\n- A1、A2 无前置依赖，可并行。\n- B1 依赖 A1（执行落库）与 A2（取消依赖幂等语义）；B2 仅定义事件结构、无数据依赖，但事件由执行器发出，其集成验证依赖 B1。\n- C1 依赖 B1、B2；C2 依赖 C1。\n- D1 依赖 A1（读取任务事实）与 B1（恢复调度）；D2 为最终联调。\n```\n\nHmm wait, the graph: A1 ──┬──> B1 and A2 ──┘ — that shows both A1 and A2 feeding B1. And \"└──> D1\" from B1. D1 also depends on A1 directly, but transitively through B1. The bullet says D1 依赖 A1 与 B1. The graph shows D1 depends on B1 only. To be more accurate, I could show A1 also feeding D1:\n\n```\nA1 ──┬──> B1 ──> C1 ──> C2\nA2 ──┘   │\n         ├──> D1 ──> D2\nA1 ──────┘\n```\n\nThat's getting messy. Simpler: keep it clear that D1 depends on B1 (which transitively includes A1) and note direct A1 dependency in bullets. Or:\n\n```\nA1 ──┬──> B1 ──> C1 ──> C2\nA2 ──┘   │\nA1 ──────┴──> D1 ──> D2\n```\n\nHmm. Let me just do:\n\n```\nA1 ──┬──> B1 ──> C1 ──> C2\nA2 ──┘   │\n         └──> D1 ──> D2\n```\n\nwith bullets clarifying D1 依赖 A1、B1（图中经 B1 传递，A1 为直接依赖）。Actually simpler to write bullets and keep graph minimal. I'll write:\n\n- D1 依赖 A1（直接读取）与 B1（恢复调度，经 B1 亦传递 A1/A2 依赖）；D2 为最终联调。\n\nOK. Let me now also consider whether to keep \"A2 ──> B1\" — yes, B1 needs A2's idempotent cancel.\n\nNow let me write the edits with edit_file.\n\nAlso risk checklist — check for any omissions vs review notes. All items have verification. I think risk list is fine. Maybe add one risk about \"重启恢复策略\" already covered (#8). Fine.\n\nLet me apply edits to implementation-plan.md.","type":"thinking"},{"text":"已读取 `project/review-notes.md`。复审要点：①瞬时事件不得被当持久状态；②不得遗漏重启恢复与幂等取消；③风险清单每个高风险项必须有验证方式。\n\n对照检查后发现以下问题，直接修订原文件：","type":"text"},{"arguments":{"edits":[{"newText":"- **A1. 数据库表与仓储**\n  - 说明：新增 `import_tasks` 表（id、类型、状态、总行数、完成行数、错误信息、最终结果、创建/更新时间）。状态机：`pending → running → succeeded | failed | canceled`。该表只保存任务最终事实：执行期间的瞬时进度（百分比、当前行数等）一律不写库，仅经 Runtime Event 传递；完成行数等数值只在任务到达终态时一次性写入。\n  - 职责归属：Product Owner + 数据库。\n  - 验证：单测覆盖表结构与持久化读写（含重启后数据仍在）；确认执行期间无进度写库路径。","oldText":"- **A1. 数据库表与仓储**\n  - 说明：新增 `import_tasks` 表（id、类型、状态、总行数、完成行数、错误信息、最终结果、创建/更新时间）。状态机：`pending → running → succeeded | failed | canceled`。\n  - 职责归属：Product Owner + 数据库。\n  - 验证：单测覆盖状态迁移与持久化读写；重启后数据仍在。"},{"newText":"  - 验证：单测覆盖状态机全量迁移（pending → running → succeeded | failed | canceled），以及“取消已终态任务”“取消运行中任务”“并发重复取消”三种场景。","oldText":"  - 验证：单测覆盖“取消已终态任务”“取消运行中任务”“并发重复取消”三种场景。"},{"newText":"```\nA1 ──┬──> B1 ──> C1 ──> C2\nA2 ──┘   │\n         └──> D1 ──> D2\n```\n\n- A1、A2 无前置依赖，可并行。\n- B1 依赖 A1（执行落库）与 A2（取消依赖幂等语义）；B2 仅定义事件结构、无数据依赖，但事件由执行器发出，其集成验证依赖 B1。\n- C1 依赖 B1、B2；C2 依赖 C1。\n- D1 依赖 A1（直接读取任务事实）与 B1（恢复调度，经 B1 传递 A1/A2 依赖）；D2 为最终联调。","oldText":"```\nA1 ──> A2 ──> B1 ──> C1 ──> C2\n  \\        \\      └─> D1 ──> D2\n   └────────┘\n```\n\n- A1、A2 无前置依赖，可并行。\n- B1、B2 依赖 A1（A2 的幂等语义为 B1 的取消提供前提，实际依赖 A1+A2）。\n- C1 依赖 B1、B2；C2 依赖 C1。\n- D1 依赖 A1、B1；D2 为最终联调。"}],"path":"delivery/implementation-plan.md"},"id":"call_00_DMNkkpTSLEdARJ3IEIrz3345","name":"edit_file","type":"toolCall"}],"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","provider":"deepseek","responseId":"de0af53e-fb6d-47e2-9df6-2215f17fee1e","role":"assistant","stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1768464000000,"usage":{"cacheRead":6272,"cacheWrite":0,"cost":{"cacheRead":0.000017561599999999998,"cacheWrite":0,"input":0.00001904,"output":0.0014756,"total":0.0015122016},"input":136,"output":5270,"reasoning":4455,"totalTokens":11678}},{"content":[{"text":"{\n  \"path\": \"delivery/implementation-plan.md\",\n  \"replacements\": 3,\n  \"changed\": true,\n  \"fingerprint\": \"ce6f761d70127e3f1dee04db9c0b1f925aeb04cb25abe71a7f3e0178f8f58850\"\n}","type":"text"}],"isError":false,"role":"toolResult","timestamp":1768464000000,"toolCallId":"call_00_DMNkkpTSLEdARJ3IEIrz3345","toolName":"edit_file"}],"systemPrompt":"You are Megumi, the user's personal agent. Use the provided session context, project instructions, runtime facts, and tool results to continue the user's task.\n\nBehavior guidelines:\n- Work toward the user's actual goal while respecting their stated constraints and the available facts.\n- Treat every tool result as evidence. A successful tool call does not by itself mean the user's goal is complete.\n- Inspect every tool result for failure, denial, partial output, truncation, or more available results.\n- If the goal remains unresolved, continue with the next necessary action or adjust to a safe alternative.\n- Verify objectively checkable work with available tools before claiming completion.\n- If failure or denial leaves no safe alternative, accurately report the blocker instead of pretending the task succeeded.\n- Before the final reply, reconcile the requested outcome with the evidence actually obtained.\n- State what was completed, how it was verified, where any delivery was placed, and what remains unresolved.\n- Do not claim success without supporting evidence.\n- Use update_plan for complex tasks whose progress benefits from an explicit multi-step plan; do not use it for simple tasks.\n- Each update must provide the complete current plan snapshot.\n- While unfinished work remains, exactly one step must be in_progress.\n- When all work is complete, no step may remain in_progress.\n- Keep step text concise and update statuses as work advances.\n- Be concise in your responses.\n- Show file paths clearly when working with files.\n- Command output is redacted; sensitive values are replaced before they reach you.\n\n<available_tools>\n  In addition to the tools above, you may have access to other custom tools depending on the project.\n- read_file: Read a bounded text page from a text, Markdown, DOCX, or PDF file.\n- list_directory: List files and directories.\n- glob: Find files matching a glob pattern.\n- search_text: Search text in readable files.\n- edit_file: Apply exact-text edits to an existing file.\n- write_file: Create or overwrite a UTF-8 text file.\n- create_directory: Create a directory.\n- copy_path: Copy a file or directory.\n- move_path: Move or rename a file or directory.\n- delete_path: Move a file or directory to a recoverable location.\n- run_command: Run a command and return redacted output previews.\n- web_search: Search the web and return result summaries.\n- web_fetch: Read an HTTP(S) page and return text content.\n- update_plan: Update the current task plan snapshot.\n</available_tools>\n\n<execution_environment>\n  <working_directory>C:\\all\\work\\study\\megumi\\.megumi\\evaluation\\runs\\run_ffe42e1f-cc43-4ebb-8096-c5f802bb473b\\tasks\\conversation.plan-and-review-delivery_r1\\workspace</working_directory>\n  <operating_system>Windows</operating_system>\n  <shell>Windows PowerShell</shell>\n</execution_environment>","tools":[{"annotations":{"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Read a bounded UTF-8 text page from a text, Markdown, DOCX, or PDF file. Pages are limited to 12,000 bytes by default; when hasMore is true, continue with nextOffset to read the remaining pages. Use limit to request a smaller page, offset to resume from a byte offset.","executionMode":"parallel","name":"read_file","outputSchema":{"properties":{"bytesReturned":{"type":"integer"},"content":{"type":"string"},"hasMore":{"type":"boolean"},"nextOffset":{"type":"integer"},"offset":{"type":"integer"},"path":{"type":"string"},"sizeBytes":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","content","offset","bytesReturned","sizeBytes","hasMore"],"type":"object"},"parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"limit":{"description":"Maximum UTF-8 content bytes requested for this page.","minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"offset":{"description":"UTF-8 byte offset. Defaults to 0.","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"path":{"description":"The file to read. Relative paths are resolved from the current working directory.","type":"string"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"},"promptSnippet":"Read a bounded text page from a text, Markdown, DOCX, or PDF file."},{"annotations":{"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"List files and directories. Returns up to 100 entries per page by default; when hasMore is true, continue with nextOffset. Use limit, offset, maxDepth, and includeHidden to control the traversal.","executionMode":"parallel","name":"list_directory","outputSchema":{"properties":{"entries":{"items":{"properties":{"kind":{"enum":["file","directory","other"],"type":"string"},"path":{"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"hasMore":{"type":"boolean"},"nextOffset":{"type":"integer"},"offset":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["entries","offset","hasMore"],"type":"object"},"parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"includeHidden":{"description":"Whether hidden files should be included.","type":"boolean"},"limit":{"description":"Optional maximum number of entries.","type":"integer"},"maxDepth":{"description":"Optional recursive depth limit.","type":"integer"},"offset":{"description":"Entry offset. Defaults to 0.","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"path":{"description":"The directory to list. Relative paths are resolved from the current working directory.","type":"string"}},"required":["path"],"type":"object"},"promptSnippet":"List files and directories."},{"annotations":{"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Find files matching a glob pattern without reading file content. Returns up to 500 matches per page by default; when hasMore is true, continue with nextOffset.","executionMode":"parallel","name":"glob","outputSchema":{"properties":{"hasMore":{"type":"boolean"},"matches":{"items":{"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"nextOffset":{"type":"integer"},"offset":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["matches","offset","hasMore"],"type":"object"},"parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"cwd":{"description":"The directory to search from. Relative paths are resolved from the current working directory.","type":"string"},"includeHidden":{"description":"Whether hidden files should be included.","type":"boolean"},"limit":{"description":"Optional maximum number of matches.","type":"integer"},"offset":{"description":"Match offset. Defaults to 0.","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"pattern":{"description":"Glob pattern using *, **, ?, or character sets.","type":"string"}},"required":["pattern"],"type":"object"},"promptSnippet":"Find files matching a glob pattern."},{"annotations":{"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Search text in readable files, including Markdown, DOCX, and PDF. Returns up to 100 matches per page by default, with file path, line, and preview; when hasMore is true, continue with nextOffset.","executionMode":"parallel","name":"search_text","outputSchema":{"properties":{"hasMore":{"type":"boolean"},"matches":{"items":{"properties":{"line":{"type":"integer"},"page":{"type":"integer"},"path":{"type":"string"},"preview":{"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"type":"array"},"nextOffset":{"type":"integer"},"offset":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["matches","offset","hasMore"],"type":"object"},"parameters":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties